WEBVTT

00:04:29.956 --> 00:04:34.916
Now, I know some of you may be asking:
Is this company greenwashing?

00:04:34.956 --> 00:04:37.036
Are they really
going to be able to do that?

00:04:37.036 --> 00:04:38.756
Will they do it on time?

00:04:38.796 --> 00:04:42.316
But what I can tell you is
that the company's already making

00:04:42.356 --> 00:04:45.196
significant investments
towards these goals

00:04:45.196 --> 00:04:47.516
and as shareholders,

00:04:47.516 --> 00:04:51.236
we're going to be long-term
capital providers

00:04:51.276 --> 00:04:56.036
to stick with them and encourage them
to achieve these goals along the way.

00:04:57.036 --> 00:05:01.276
(Applause)